{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "f313e3f9af048d1d78e5c9c658b202c5144cae6c950dd63359de36f5392fcbfd", "ja": "想 ～Noise～", "zh": "想 ～Noise～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c4400566b2c2eba2bce3dd990ce46496b5d9f34f155a33cf2b2b0eda1304aef1", "ja": "自前で借りたスタジオで、ひとり歌い込む千\n早の元に、律子と真が訪れる。静香が落ち込\nんでいると聞いた千早は、それは誤解だと慌\nてる。本当の気持ちを伝えるため、千早は真\n剣な表情でスマホと向き合うのだった。", "zh": "千早在自己租来的录音室里独自反复练唱时，律子和真来找她了。听说静香情绪低落后，千早慌忙表示那是误会。为了传达自己真正的心情，千早神情认真地面对着手机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "c967c4d514183b2950ab1f9784f11a3934db68de493ea7a98d8bed92b4c62f04", "ja": "ここは、強い気持ちで……。違う。\nもっと……求めるように……。", "zh": "这里要带着强烈的情感……不对。\n要更加……像是在渴求一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7bd9f2ac20e4239cf08be320dffd2b3534b28d84a3c5b98d3a376db4f002a616", "ja": "えーっと……あっ、いたいた。\nお疲れさま、千早っ！", "zh": "呃……啊，在这儿在这儿。\n辛苦了，千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "fb081f1f2363912a14c24ad3db33ad0c3c37f9d0acbca7d2502cd5e3054579f6", "ja": "えっ？　真、律子も……。\nどうしてここに？", "zh": "咦？真、律子也……。\n你们怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb46ee09dbb1f3d1ca9a385ed8bfddd477730e609e64fea43aa21112739bd521", "ja": "{$P$}に頼まれたのよ。\n千早の様子を見てきてくれ～、って。", "zh": "是{$P$}拜托我的。\n让我过来看看千早的情况——，就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "f41f1a83edd537e01849159366fbe8cacbcd1f44b8abb959c689d3e441a0fe42", "ja": "{$P$}……あっ。\nそうだわ、私、連絡してない……！", "zh": "{$P$}……啊。对了，我还没联系……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "dc60140e4358ae782ee953e0b3bc83e3b1ddf8d182d37739a680daf7a70b3413", "ja": "ここも自分で押さえたんですって？\nまったくもう、どれだけ先走れば気が済むのかしら？", "zh": "这里也是你自己订下来的？真是的，到底要急成什么样才满意啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "2a3818aa6bb1c1a4406a5b2c005a27d15041fd36634e78b6f0c1c6703b65548a", "ja": "そ、そうよね。ごめんなさい。\n気がはやってしまって、つい……。", "zh": "对、对啊。对不起。\n一时太心急了，不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "9db26e868fcc4bc6dd606dc2360afff970a4bb2386917a2899ea4826eb01cfa6", "ja": "まあまあ。とりあえず、差し入れでも食べようか！\n前に番組で紹介したチーズタルト、買ってきたんだ♪", "zh": "好啦好啦。总之，先吃点慰问品吧！\n我买了之前在节目里介绍过的芝士挞♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "8043bb319fe3a16c2268e4057de1df20d046da1ab3bb9cc3fd55f2cb71ff2311", "ja": "あと、普通のサンドイッチもね。\nどうせお昼も食べてないんでしょ？", "zh": "还有普通的三明治。\n反正你也还没吃午饭吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "2c505f6783f41e5c039a2a76deffaebc3a24bb0d9552e8bc588376f44ed2b43b", "ja": "そうね。まだ……え、もうそんな時間？", "zh": "是啊。还……诶，已经到这个时间了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "2f061c02b0cb6139ffd80e48effa388c50bb22a43dfaea43df530e60a82304f2", "ja": "どっちかっていうと、もうおやつの時間かな。\nはい、休憩休憩！　ボク、お茶淹れてくるね！", "zh": "非要说的话，差不多该到吃点心的时间了吧。\n好啦，休息休息！我去泡茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "272537db41572233efa82ef93290879b8ca1a158a04194c7ce0625d56cce5400", "ja": "それにしても、静香と千早のデュオか……。あははっ、\n気がはやるのもわかるけどね。ボクも楽しみだもん！", "zh": "不过话说回来，是静香和千早的二重唱啊……啊哈哈，能理解你迫不及待的心情。不过我也很期待嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "dc240348f12bc88c540a959be8627280ac604e2f958ec236b88b57a6b153e937", "ja": "そうねえ。\n千早、珍しく立候補したんですって？", "zh": "是啊。\n听说千早这次难得主动报名了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "0269964e523947fa91c02bfb99db6e595b037bad8dd21e370aed1e4968327e50", "ja": "ええ。本当に素敵な曲なの。\n落差のある旋律を、力強く、畳み掛けるように繋げて。", "zh": "是啊。这真的是一首非常棒的歌。\n将起伏鲜明的旋律强劲地连缀起来，层层推进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "72ea183512593e7743b588f8e7c7923acd860d39419d9aa4166cb13787ba3577", "ja": "情熱をありのままに奏でる……そんな歌。\nとても歌い甲斐があるわ。", "zh": "将热情毫无保留地演绎出来……就是这样的歌。\n非常值得好好唱一唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "966094ae1a0cfbf811fb7b8372578e48f635fdd4096cb82e13881e1a3c8b3a63", "ja": "きっと……静香に、似合うと思う。", "zh": "我想，这首歌一定很适合静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "9a754c75907d283e30c592f570a96e8783df369e23984b39be3cd093c5aadba8", "ja": "あら、なに遠慮してるの？\nそこは静香と千早に、でしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，干吗这么客气？\n应该说是送给静香和千早的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "b544eacd5697c24b547b47a77234f8882511ef40b0f8be783ab00077f16ef386", "ja": "あ……そうね。でも……。\n今までの私の歌とは、少し違うと思う。", "zh": "啊……是啊。不过……我觉得，这和我以前唱的歌，有些不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "0ef479397e2aa913b33b1c7079ef862170b71cc3bda08ae23b5b0705991571b5", "ja": "ステージに賭ける情熱が、荒々しいぐらい、\nほとばしって。……まっすぐで、堂々としていて。", "zh": "对舞台的热情奔涌而出，甚至可以说有些狂放。……坦率而堂堂正正。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "5f4a114e2efa7f1e094a4f75960b2cad0b49b655ea5224c012f12ac3edb4fbec", "ja": "私にはきっと、挑戦になるわ。どこまで\nさらけだせるか、どこまで受け止められるか……。", "zh": "对我来说，一定会是场挑战。究竟能展现出多少真实的自己，又能接受多少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "18303d9c7224ae6f8869ddae5135e9a8214ba5a1b108a50c36990032b45dd99f", "ja": "どこまで……、届くのか。\n二人なら、どこまで……。", "zh": "究竟能传达到哪里……。\n如果是两个人，又能走到哪一步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "24ed56301f49d10455ed5b14a5e533111a91d90c7e7f9a65b101fe1fd04f02dd", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさい。\n私、ヘンなこと……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n我说了些奇怪的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "12982035752a562ce4d529b3a534b143f1c12ec64905962a0ee58ad3c2bff1dc", "ja": "ううん、全然ヘンじゃないよ。\nなんか……いいよね、そういうの！", "zh": "嗯，完全不奇怪哦。\n总觉得……那样挺好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "55c96d851f959dcff196a0a2bd96edc980b56a6f83895d2b6537662f72b57a71", "ja": "え？　そういうのって……どういうの？", "zh": "诶？你说的那种……是哪种？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "f41621780ec7fa217cac264760d14583f0631b7624bde023d82c8163d1fc7c3b", "ja": "あははっ、気にしないで！\nとにかく、なんだか千早がまぶしいってコト！", "zh": "啊哈哈，别介意！\n总之，就是觉得千早好像在闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "8cb1a8b67e207cda1f80d370c12a711ad7d4fde2a8d0492eeeeb9eb83456f909", "ja": "でも、当の静香は、落ち込んでたらしいわよ？\n千早に相手にされてない～って！", "zh": "不过，据说当事人静香好像正情绪低落呢？\n因为觉得千早根本没把她当回事——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "59fe05982b3a891b410f2512379c573a370b847bd08c538006c26ed1372d5230", "ja": "え？　……ええっ！？　私、そんなつもりじゃ……！\nどうしよう、とんでもない誤解……", "zh": "诶？……诶诶！？我、我不是那个意思……！\n怎么办，竟然产生了这么大的误会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "1f6951e79ef55866d1f12b85ca42f14d9fb14f3e0743205841731218c3081d61", "ja": "やっぱり勝手すぎたのね。私、つい夢中で……。\nあ、メッセージ！　送った方がいい？", "zh": "果然是我太任性了。我一时太投入了……\n啊，发条消息！是不是发一条比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "b6d1b145e63ca2915a1b861a27da457f8cc75c50d8a1f6765bf34b3ca2f918a7", "ja": "うーん、そうだねえ。直接言った方がいいけど、\nこういうのは、早く気持ちを伝えることも大事だから。", "zh": "嗯——是啊。虽然直接说比较好，但这种事，及时传达自己的心意也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "8983fc8d1886f75caaa88847939dbbb4b8d060ec766d207a0a78893bf03a67c3", "ja": "そうよね……わかったわ。やってみる。", "zh": "是啊……我明白了。我试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "f8ee96a0d96978751ea5c91c0f30e5f1f07ae65cd660836acb5f249b28873faa", "ja": "ていうか、ずいぶん慣れたのね？\nメッセージアプリ、あんなに苦手だったのに。", "zh": "话说回来，你已经相当习惯了呢？\n明明以前那么不擅长用消息应用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "4e1558e89de757338916b3923748b9df5a9419f840e3f33f402965fa666e0104", "ja": "あ、そうだよね？　こないだもボクに、\n響宛のメッセージ送って来たよね？", "zh": "啊，对哦？前阵子你还给我发过一条写给响的消息，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "3794adb644894f3c253e01a34ffe2e57355e744f7518f22e9e5db72c36ecb801", "ja": "最近、所さんが色々教えてくれて……。\nスタンプも増えたの。わからないけど。", "zh": "最近所小姐教了我好多……。\n表情包也多了。虽然我也不太懂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "b967629cecf1db9d3a3a593083a2852a6f01431b276389435814c6b577614672", "ja": "へえ～、さすが恵美だなあ！\n……わからないって、何が？", "zh": "哦～不愧是惠美啊！\n……你说不知道，是什么不知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1040_002chi", "source_sha256": "838b4e6b5d03001a6f971ba8fa7824c98cc638be5439e824d20580bef47ae927", "ja": "えっと……。ごめんなさい、\n集中しないと……操作を間違えるから。", "zh": "那个……对不起，\n不集中注意力的话……会操作失误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0137_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_03_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "6c969f9fe043de78b4088104eb73f369786b7a063eb5245a0b550ec94d48fe6f", "ja": "そ、そっか……。わかった、頑張って。", "zh": "这、这样啊……我知道了，加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
